      "collectionLists.label": "Three lists cached in the store from getTodos({ userId: 1 }), getTodos({ userId: 2 }) and getTodos(). A todo with userId 1 that push or unshift creates joins the userId 1 list and the unfiltered list, at the end or the start, and never the userId 2 list, because a list gets an item only when every argument it was fetched with appears in the call. remove takes it out of the same lists; move takes it out of the userId 1 list and into the userId 2 list, and the unfiltered list keeps it",
